---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 36
    messageMargin: 24
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Network as External IoT network
    participant Sensor as Suricata
    participant EVE as EVE log
    participant Agent as Sensor agent
    participant API as Sensor API
    participant DB as Persistence
    participant Publisher as Outbox publisher
    actor UI as Dashboard

    Network-)Sensor: Network packets
    Sensor-)EVE: Append alerts and statistics

    loop each polling cycle
        Agent->>EVE: Read from durable checkpoint
        EVE-->>Agent: Normalized records and next offset
        opt records available or heartbeat due
            Agent->>API: Submit authenticated batch
            API->>DB: Update sensor state and deduplicate alerts
            alt new signature alert
                API->>DB: Insert alert and outbox event
            else statistics or duplicate
                API->>DB: Update counters only
            end
            API->>DB: Commit batch
            alt accepted receipt
                API-->>Agent: 200 SuricataReceipt
                Agent->>Agent: Advance checkpoint atomically
            else delivery failed
                API--xAgent: No accepted receipt
                Agent->>Agent: Retain offset and back off
            end
        end
    end

    loop each committed alert event
        Publisher->>DB: Claim unpublished event
        DB-->>Publisher: alert.created payload
        Publisher-)UI: WebSocket alert
        Publisher->>DB: Mark published or retry
    end
